qualification = "Rust preserves nullable email, omitted watchlist and the verification flag; require_watchlist guards watchlist-dependent access. The integration test starts a loopback HTTP account peer, replays wallet/unverified-email/verified-email session bodies, validates cookies/API keys/CSRF, and drives the production token and metadata clients over GET and POST without external configuration."
